<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Asas Dunia shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Asas Dunia shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of Asas Dunia Bhd has been suspended at the request of the company pending an announcement, a Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Shares of property and construction-based Asas Dunia were last traded this morning at 9.65 ringgit, up 30 cents.</p>
<p>Officials of the company could not be reached immediately for comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
